[% if module_kind == 'code' %]## Third-party notices

`yarn build` generates `dist/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt` from the dependencies included in the bundle. The release ZIP includes this file with the rest of `dist`. It preserves the licence and NOTICE text supplied by those packages; a dependency without a declared licence fails the build.

Run `yarn test:notices` to check the generator. Keep notices for copied source, artwork and other assets in the root `THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt`; the build appends that maintained text to the generated file.

[% endif %]## Template updates

This repository was created from `FaeyUmbrea/module-template`. The source recorded in `.copier-answers.yml` should be `gh:FaeyUmbrea/module-template`, not a path to somebody's local checkout. With a clean worktree, update its shared machinery using:

```sh
uvx copier update
```
